(text "NUCLEO POWER CONFIGURATION\nJP2: fit EXT jumper on pins 5-6.\nBuck +5 V -> CN11 pin 6; ground -> CN11 pin 8.\nCN8 pin 7 supplies 3.3 V to interface/storage.\n5V_EXT input: 4.75-5.25 V, 500 mA maximum.\nPower EXT first, then connect ST-Link USB CN1.\nDo not connect 24 V to Nucleo VIN or logic pins.\nSTLINK-V3 MCO: HSE/5 = 5 MHz (persistent setting).\nTarget HSE bypass; CPU 480 MHz / timer kernels 240 MHz." (at 20.32 139.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e5e7b91d-1738-5027-ae0b-7ef0a285cd9d"))
(text "BOARD ROUTING / TIM2 DMA STEP OUTPUTS\nPA0 -> CN10.29: SB75 ON; user button stays PC13.\nQSPI: SB59/SB63 ON; SB61/SB69 OFF.\nPE2 -> CN10.25: SB67 OFF.\nOnly used external contacts are drawn.\nEthernet, ST-Link, LEDs and button stay onboard." (at 20.32 170.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7942897a-c057-5c70-bd8f-20bde05d3663"))
